id: eject
name: Eject
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
special: true
usageLimit: 1/encounter
# "Move a number of Squares away from the Vehicle/Battle Jacket in a straight line equal to your number of Skill Ranks
# in Piloting" - said on the card from the Pilot Ranks.
moveSkill: pilot
movePerRank: 1
says: >
  Out of the Vehicle/Battle Jacket, in a straight line away from it. An attack already aimed at it still lands on it as
  if you were its Pilot.
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Leave a Vehicle or Battle Jacket at once, moving away from it a Square for each Pilot Rank.
text: >
  Eject Maneuver [1/Encounter]: Escape from your vehicle in a hurry!
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Effect: Immediately leave a Vehicle/Battle Jacket and move a number of Squares away from the Vehicle/Battle Jacket in a
  straight line equal to your number of Skill Ranks in Piloting. If that Vehicle/Battle Jacket was targeted for an
  Attacking Maneuver when you used this effect, and you were the Pilot, carry out that Attacking Maneuver against the
  Vehicle/Battle Jacket as if you were still the Pilot.

---

# Opened by 2+ Ranks in Pilot, like every other Skill's. Vehicles and Battle Jackets are not built in this system: the
# leaving and the attack carried out against it are the table's; the card says how far.
